    "title": "Popular Boston-Based Anna's Taqueria to Open First-Ever Rhode Island Location in Cranston - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Kenneth Simmons ,\n14 hours ago Cranston, Rhode Island – Anna’s Taqueria, a well-known Mexican restaurant brand with deep roots in Boston, is set to make its Rhode Island debut later this month with a new location at Garden City Center in Cranston. The opening marks a major expansion milestone for the brand as it continues to grow across southern New England. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
